# Copy to .env or export directly. Never commit real keys.
GH_TOKEN=
# Optional: pin the review panel (comma/space-separated model roles, first = synthesizer).
# REVIEW_PANEL=
# Optional: cap pre-run spend in USD (plain number; env wins over .review/budget file).
# With a budget set, fetch/fetch-local print a cost estimate from comparable past
# runs and refuse projected-over-budget runs unless passed --consent-over-budget.
# Unset: no estimates, no gates — today's behavior.
# REVIEW_BUDGET_USD=
# Optional: override the fetch diff-size cap in bytes (plain integer; env wins
# over .review/max_bytes file). Deliberate exceptions only — release diffs,
# vendor drops; the default 512000 cap stands otherwise. Unset: default cap.
# REVIEW_MAX_BYTES=
# Optional: knowledge-base auto-retirement thresholds (defaults 5 and 0.5).
# After any credit, a rule with judged at/above REVIEW_KB_MIN_JUDGED and
# false_hits/judged above REVIEW_KB_MAX_FP_RATE retires (tombstone kept).
# REVIEW_KB_MIN_JUDGED=5
# REVIEW_KB_MAX_FP_RATE=0.5
